<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντᾰχοῦ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>everywhere</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.117
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πενταχοῦ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.108
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ φρονοῦντες εὖ κρατοῦσι π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					1252
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδαμοῦ καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					568
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄλλοθι π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Chrm.</u>
					160a
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς γῆς</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαχοῦ</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				111a
			</span></i>: later with Verbs of Motion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξῆλθε ἡ ἀκοὴ αὐτοῦ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Marc.</u>
					1.28
				</span></i>
			: in early writers <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανταχοῖ</span>
			should be restd., as <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1230
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>altogether, absolutely</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				503a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ π. ᾔσθησαι</span> not
				<i>at all</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prm.</u>
				128b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
